# 泛型剩余边界 #2：跨模块同名特化值身份（geo.Box[int] 值正确，type() 显示特化名）
# doc: docs/architecture/08_storage_model.md
# expect-class: PASS
# expect-out: 105 | hi! | Box[int]
# expect-exit: 0
import geo
import graph
geo.Box[int] a = geo.Box[int](105)
graph.Box[str] b = graph.Box[str]("hi!")
print(a.get())
print(b.get())
print(type(a))
